655d0691</link><description>&lt;p&gt;两天后在墨西哥城看安德烈斯·卡拉马罗的演唱会。用我很久以前画的这幅插画庆祝一下 :)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="An illustration of a faceless musician, based on an old pic of Andrés Calamaro, an Argentinian singer/musician." height="1440" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/axel/6af53655d0691.jpg" width="1440"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://axel.some.pics"&gt;@axel&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 03:45:28 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>放下工具，留下智慧</title><link>https://some.pics/6af51a6e47dc4</link><description>&lt;p&gt;放下一个工具并不会抹去你所学到的东西。如果你不再使用一副卡牌，你可以把它传给会喜欢它的人。你可以珍视与它共度的时光，而不必永远保留它。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted charcoal-and-rose fantasy scene of a silver-haired witch handing a boxed card deck to a friend at a riverside landing, while an enormous white swan carries a rose-trimmed passenger cabin. Warm ivory lettering fills the dark canopy, and the gold reference emblem appears at bottom-right. Text: Letting go of a tool doesn't erase what you learned. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6af51a6e47dc4.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 01:46:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>橡树</title><link>https://some.pics/6af50e77360b5</link><description>&lt;p&gt;橡树&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Low-angle view looking up through thick tree branches and green leaves lit by sunlight against a clear blue sky." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/macmanx/6af50e77360b5.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://macmanx.some.pics"&gt;@macmanx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:55:24 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>你好墨西哥城</title><link>https://some.pics/6af4fb1bde84f</link><description>&lt;p&gt;你好，墨西哥城！&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Night view of Mexico City from my hotel room's window" height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/axel/6af4fb1bde84f.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://axel.some.pics"&gt;@axel&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 23:32:47 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>林中迷路乐趣多</title><link>https://some.pics/6af4d4a99726d</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在树林里迷路怎么会不好玩呢！树叶都落光了，我确实有时觉得本可以自己开辟小径，嗯，或者至少比实际走的更随性一些。😬&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Bare trees stand on a steep, leaf-covered slope in a dense, overcast forest." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/ericmwalk/6af4d4a99726d.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://ericmwalk.some.pics"&gt;@ericmwalk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:48:51 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>